---
description: Require red tests before implementation for each capability slice.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Tests First

- Start each implementation slice from accepted requirements and OpenSpec scenarios.
- Add or update failing tests before production code, then confirm the failure is meaningful.
- Do not weaken assertions, delete tests, skip tests, or lower thresholds to make a slice pass.
- Keep tests deterministic and fast; isolate real-model evals in `evals/` rather than regular unit tests.
- Cite requirement IDs in test names, traits, or `@trace FR-*` comments once the test projects exist.
